2026-01-01 open Assets:A
2026-01-01 open Assets:B
2026-01-01 open Assets:C

2026-02-01 * "a product adds the exponents"
  Assets:A  (1.50 * 2) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-02 * "1.5 * 2.25"
  Assets:A  (1.5 * 2.25) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-03 * "2.0 * 3"
  Assets:A  (2.0 * 3) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-04 * "more places than either factor"
  Assets:A  (0.10 * 0.10) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-05 * "below 0.000001: an exponent shows"
  Assets:A  (0.001 * 0.001 * 0.001) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-06 * "1000000.0 * 1000000"
  Assets:A  (1000000.0 * 1000000) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-07 * "100 * 1000000"
  Assets:A  (100 * 1000000) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-08 * "0.1 * 3"
  Assets:A  (0.1 * 3) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-09 * "a sum keeps the finer places"
  Assets:A  (0.1 + 0.20) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-10 * "1.00 + 2"
  Assets:A  (1.00 + 2) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-11 * "1 + 2.00"
  Assets:A  (1 + 2.00) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-12 * "a difference keeps the finer places too"
  Assets:A  (1.10 - 0.1) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-13 * "2.50 - 2.5"
  Assets:A  (2.50 - 2.5) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-14 * "commas are digit groups in an expression too"
  Assets:A  (1,000.50 * 2) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-15 * "rounded to 28 digits"
  Assets:A  (0.1234567890123456789 * 0.1234567890123456789) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-02-21 * "22 digits and no more"
  Assets:A  (100000000000000000000 * 100) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-03-01 * "the elided posting takes the fewest places written: the expression has many"
  Assets:A  (10 / 3) EUR
  Assets:A  1.5 EUR
  Assets:B

2026-03-02 * "an expression with no places does not count"
  Assets:A  (10 / 4) EUR
  Assets:A  (4 / 2) EUR
  Assets:B

2026-03-03 * "the places of a product count"
  Assets:A  (1.5 * 2) EUR
  Assets:A  1.25 EUR
  Assets:B
